   227				// opaque/no-colon platform id fails closed (unlisted) — same as the prior
   228				// path, which only ever listed `LIKE '%:%'` platform ids. Failing closed
   229				// is safe; the same-channel-across-two-workspaces (Grid) case is likewise
   230				// handled by isConversationVisible failing closed on team ambiguity.
   231				if (byKey.has(row.conversationId)) continue;
   232				if (channelVis && !isConversationVisible(row.conversationId, channelVis)) {
